278
00:13:35.398 --> 00:13:37.066
Magandang gabi.

279
00:13:42.155 --> 00:13:43.740
WALA NA AKONG GAGAWA ULIT PARA Istorbohin ka

280
00:13:43.823 --> 00:13:44.824
[Nagvibrate ang telepono]

281
