Hindi ka maaaring mag-jog ng ilang sandali, bagaman.

289
00:14:20.985 --> 00:14:22.070
-Hapunan?
-[hindi malinaw na satsat]

290
00:14:22.653 --> 00:14:23.905
Ano sa lupa--

291
00:14:28.034 --> 00:14:29.202
Ano ba naman?

292
00:14:29.285 --> 00:14:31.996
-[Wooju's mom] Saan tayo pupunta?
-Hindi ko alam. Tara sa taas.

293
00:14:33.164 --> 00:14:34.665
[parehong patuloy na hindi malinaw]

294
00:14:37.085 --> 00:14:38.377
Oo, sige.

295
00:14:39.170 --> 00:14:40.588
