302
00:14:52.850 --> 00:14:54.393
Magaling.

303
00:14:54.477 --> 00:14:57.230
Hawakan ito at kuskusin saglit.

304
00:14:57.313 --> 00:14:59.190
Lean forward para mahila ko ang pantalon mo.

305
00:15:02.318 --> 00:15:03.402
Oh, tara na!

306
00:15:03.486 --> 00:15:05.071
-Tapos na tayo. Mabuti para sa iyo.
-Salamat.

307
