336
00:16:40.333 --> 00:16:41.584
[Wooju crying] Nanay!

337
00:16:41.667 --> 00:16:43.878
[Umiiyak ang nanay ni Wooju] Wooju.
Ang mahal kong anak. Baby ko.

338
00:16:43.961 --> 00:16:45.338
Sobrang sakit dapat.

339
