[Wooju] Sabi ng punk na yun, naamoy ko!

340
00:16:50.593 --> 00:16:52.094
-[Kapatid ni Wooju] Ganito ba?
- Medyo mas mataas.

341
00:16:52.178 --> 00:16:54.013
-Mas mataas.
-[Kapatid ni Wooju] Mas mataas?

342
