Hihingi sana siya
ibinibigay namin ang deposito sa pabahay.

355
00:17:24.418 --> 00:17:27.463
Naunahan ko na siya bago niya magawa.

356
00:17:28.047 --> 00:17:29.090
Okay, fine.

357
00:17:29.173 --> 00:17:30.841
Bakit ka pa hihingi ng tawad sa kanya?

358
00:17:32.468 --> 00:17:33.594
ikaw ba...

359
00:17:34.637 --> 00:17:36.305
Gusto mo bang makipagbalikan sa kanya?

360
00:17:36.389 --> 00:17:37.765
[Nanay ni Wooju] Wooju.

361
00:17:37.848 --> 00:17:39.100
Sabihin mo sa amin ang totoo.

362
00:17:39.809 --> 00:17:40.851
Paano si Jenny?

363
00:17:40.935 --> 00:17:41.936
Naghiwalay kami.

364
00:17:42.770 --> 00:17:43.938
-Ano?
-Ano?

365
00:17:44.021 --> 00:17:45.648
