377
00:18:12.383 --> 00:18:13.551
[umiiyak] Nanay.

378
00:18:15.428 --> 00:18:17.430
Mahal na mahal ko yata si Meri.

379
00:18:19.390 --> 00:18:21.434
Hindi ko akalain na mabubuhay ako ng wala siya.

380
00:18:23.686 --> 00:18:24.687
Nanay.

381
00:18:25.521 --> 00:18:29.191
Pwede ka bang humingi ng tawad sa kanya
