382
00:18:30.318 --> 00:18:32.236
Kung iiwan ako ni Meri,

383
00:18:32.320 --> 00:18:34.947
Baka mapunta lang ako sa kung saan at mamatay!

384
00:18:35.031 --> 00:18:36.532
