388
00:18:52.256 --> 00:18:53.257
Hoy, ikaw.

389
00:18:53.341 --> 00:18:55.217
Ikaw ay isang masamang bagay, ikaw.

390
00:18:55.843 --> 00:18:59.055
Paano mo mapapansin ang isang tao
