391
00:18:59.138 --> 00:19:02.808
Close kami noon kaya naman
Tinignan ko siya habang wala ka.

392
00:19:03.684 --> 00:19:05.728
Nagawa ko na ang aking tungkulin.

393
00:19:06.228 --> 00:19:09.023
Sabi mo bad match tayo
at sinabihan akong magwala.

394
00:19:10.399 --> 00:19:13.361
Ayokong makita ka ulit ni Wooju.

395
00:19:14.945 --> 00:19:16.030
