398
00:19:25.122 --> 00:19:26.457
[bumuntong hininga]

399
00:19:45.101 --> 00:19:46.977
-Narinig mo ba iyon?
-Oo.

400
00:19:49.730 --> 00:19:51.315
Kanina pa tayo naghiwalay,

401
00:19:51.399 --> 00:19:53.484
