446
00:22:10.329 --> 00:22:11.997
Maaari mong tingnan ito.

447
00:22:13.874 --> 00:22:15.501
[♪ kaakit-akit na musikang orkestra]

448
00:22:21.549 --> 00:22:23.676
SIMBOLISMO NG BULAKLAK NG POMPON

449
00:22:23.759 --> 00:22:26.136
[Kim Wooju] Taos-puso ang puso ko.

450
00:22:30.724 --> 00:22:31.767
